OL,3,ACatherine's emotional cancer
OL,4,Adocumentary strips away the stiff upper
OL,5,Alip
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Princess of Wales's personal
OL,8,Faccount of her experience of cancer has
OL,9,Fa soul-baring, emotionally candid tone
OL,10,Fnever presented before in a royal
OL,11,Fdocumentary.
OL,13,FDiscussing it at a private screening,
OL,14,Fshe said it reflected the "fear,
OL,15,Fanxiety, uncertainty" shared by
OL,16,Fhundreds of thousands of people each
OL,17,Fyear "who receive the words no one
OL,18,Fwants to hear" about having cancer.
OL,20,FThe documentary, Heal, being shown on
OL,21,FBBC One on Sunday, couldn't be further
OL,22,Faway from a stiff upper lip.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
