OL,3,APharmacies get new powers to swap
OL,4,Aprescriptions during shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FPharmacies are being given more freedom
OL,7,Fover the prescription medicines they
OL,8,Fcan give to patients when items are out
OL,9,Fof stock.
OL,11,FStaff will be able to offer the same
OL,12,Fdrug in a different strength or form `
OL,13,Ftwo 5mg tablets in the place of a 10mg
OL,14,Fpill, or a cream instead of an
OL,15,Fointment, for example.
OL,17,FThe change should help patients avoid
OL,18,Frepeat trips to their GP for an
OL,19,Falternative prescription when the issue
OL,20,Fcan be resolved safely and easily at
OL,21,Fthe chemist.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
